        218.4320526123047,
        145.4047393798828
      ],
      "text": "Box 2.4.3.1 PICO questions",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.40550231933594,
        161.28883361816406,
        509.16790771484375,
        174.2028350830078
      ],
      "text": "1.\t Should the MTBDRsl test be used to guide clinical decisions to use",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24800109863281,
        176.78883361816406,
        418.9350891113281,
        189.7028350830078
      ],
      "text": "fluoroquinolones in patients with confirmed MDR/RR-TB?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.98500061035156,
        194.969482421875,
        495.4384765625,
        208.11448669433594
      ],
      "text": "Direct testing (stratified by smear grade: smear negative; scanty; 1+; ≥2+).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24800109863281,
        195.58547973632812,
        127.98500061035156,
        207.7954864501953
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.98500061035156,
        216.13873291015625,
        212.7707977294922,
        229.2837371826172
      ],
      "text": "Indirect testing.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24800109863281,
        216.75473022460938,
        127.98500061035156,
        228.96473693847656
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.40550231933594,
        237.4619903564453,
        509.2120056152344,
        250.37599182128906
      ],
      "text": "2.\t Should the MTBDRsl test be used to guide clinical decisions to use SLIDs in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24800109863281,
        252.9619903564453,
        313.4670715332031,
        265.8759765625
      ],
      "text": "patients diagnosed with MDR/RR-TB?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.98509979248047,
        271.1427001953125,
        495.4384765625,
        284.2877197265625
      ],
      "text": "Direct testing (stratified by smear grade: smear negative; scanty; 1+; ≥2+).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24810028076172,
        271.7586975097656,
        127.98509979248047,
        283.9687194824219
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.98509979248047,
        292.3118896484375,
        212.7707977294922,
        305.4569091796875
      ],
      "text": "Indirect testing.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        116.24810028076172,
        292.9278869628906,
        127.98509979248047,
        305.1379089355469
      ],
      "text": "Î",
      "font": "Wingdings-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        336.8669128417969,
        526.962646484375,
        350.0119323730469
      ],
      "text": "Twenty-nine unique studies were identified; of these, 26 evaluated the MTBDR  version 1.0  sl",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.3669128417969,
        526.9589233398438,
        365.5119323730469
      ],
      "text": "assay (including 21 studies from the original Cochrane review). Three studies (one published",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.8669128417969,
        524.408203125,
        381.0119323730469
      ],
      "text": "and two unpublished) evaluated version 2.0. Data for version 1.0 and version 2.0 of the MTBDR sl",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946017265319824,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.3669128417969,
        527.0399780273438,
        396.5119323730469
      ],
      "text": "assay were analysed separately. A phenotypic culture-based DST reference standard was used",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.999249458312988,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.8669128417969,
        526.9656372070312,
        412.0119323730469
      ],
      "text": "for the primary analyses. These analyses were stratified first by susceptibility or resistance to a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.3669128417969,
        495.73394775390625,
        427.5119323730469
      ],
      "text": "particular drug, and second by type of SL-LPA testing (indirect testing or direct testing).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.8785400390625,
        495.0421142578125,
        456.2585144042969
      ],
      "text": "Performance of SL-LPA on sputum specimens and culture isolates",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.5093994140625,
        527.2813110351562,
        479.6544189453125
      ],
      "text": "In patients with MDR/RR-TB, a positive SL-LPA result for fluoroquinolone resistance (as a class) or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.0093994140625,
        527.2644653320312,
        495.1544189453125
      ],
      "text": "SLID resistance (as a group) can be treated with confidence. The diagnostic accuracy of SL-LPA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997249603271484,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.5093994140625,
        526.991943359375,
        510.6544189453125
      ],
      "text": "is similar when performed directly on sputum specimens or indirectly on cultured isolates of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.0093994140625,
        146.56710815429688,
        526.1544189453125
      ],
      "text": ". M. tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.0133056640625,
        526.5927124023438,
        550.1583251953125
      ],
      "text": "Given the confidence in a positive result and the ability of the test to provide rapid results,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.5133056640625,
        526.9925537109375,
        565.6583251953125
      ],
      "text": "the GDG felt that SL-LPA may be considered for use as an initial test for resistance to the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.0133056640625,
        526.968994140625,
        581.1583251953125
      ],
      "text": "fluoroquinolones and when relevant SLIDs. However, when the test shows a negative result,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.513427734375,
        526.6620483398438,
        596.658447265625
      ],
      "text": "phenotypic culture-based DST may be necessary, especially in settings with a high pretest",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.013427734375,
        526.6776123046875,
        612.158447265625
      ],
      "text": "probability for resistance to either fluoroquinolones or SLIDs (or both). The use of SL-LPA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.513427734375,
        526.8490600585938,
        627.658447265625
      ],
      "text": "in routine care should improve the time to the diagnosis of fluoroquinolone and where",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.013427734375,
        526.81591796875,
        643.158447265625
      ],
      "text": "relevant SLIDs, especially when used for the direct testing of sputum specimens of patients",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.513427734375,
        526.794921875,
        658.658447265625
      ],
      "text": "with confirmed MDR/RR-TB. Early detection of drug resistance should allow for the earlier",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.013427734375,
        527.0030517578125,
        674.158447265625
      ],
      "text": "initiation of appropriate patient therapy and improved patient health outcomes. Overall, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.513427734375,
        527.2154541015625,
        689.658447265625
      ],
      "text": "test performs well in the direct testing of sputum specimens from patients with confirmed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.013427734375,
        526.9699096679688,
        705.158447265625
      ],
      "text": "MDR/RR-TB, although the indeterminate rate is higher when testing smear-negative sputum",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.513427734375,
        370.0953063964844,
        720.658447265625
      ],
      "text": "specimens compared with smear-positive sputum specimens.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.517333984375,
        526.9286499023438,
        744.662353515625
      ],
      "text": "When the MTBDR  assay is used in the direct testing of smear-negative sputum specimens from  sl",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.953200340270996,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        747.017333984375,
        527.0350952148438,
        760.162353515625
      ],
      "text": "a population of patients with confirmed DR-TB, up to 44% of the results may be indeterminate",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983488082885742,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "90 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}